{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And Aaron took.</b> He mentioned Aaron's wife for the honor of Elazar, and he mentioned Nahshon's sister for the honor of the priesthood, and he mentioned the sons of Korah because they were righteous, as it is written, \"and the sons of Korah did not die\" (Numbers 26), and Samuel the prophet was of the sons of Korah."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:12.183626235Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}